                    <div class="highlight-box blue">
                        <h4>💡 The Head-to-Head That Matters: MyProtein vs. NOW Sports</h4>
                        <p style="margin-bottom:0;">Same lab, same testing window, similar price. <strong>NOW Sports came back "undetected" on lead; MyProtein came back "below LOQ."</strong> Both pass, both are far under the limit — but NOW's is the cleaner result, and NOW's Informed Sport certification tests <em>every batch</em> with retail blind-sampling. If you're splitting hairs between them, that's the hair. MyProtein counters with a wider flavor range and frequent discounting.</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="disclosure" style="background:#fdf8ec; padding:16px 20px; border-left:4px solid #e07a2f; border-radius:6px; margin:24px 0; font-size:14px;">
                        <strong>How we're funded:</strong> the links below are Amazon affiliate links — we may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. We only feature products with independent certification or clean third-party test results, and we'll tell you when another option tests cleaner.
                    </div>

                    <div class="highlight-box green">
                        <h4>✅ What We'd Buy</h4>
                        <p><strong>MyProtein Impact Whey Isolate</strong> — verified safe on current testing, huge flavor range, frequently discounted.<br>
                        <a href="https://www.amazon.com/s?k=myprotein+impact+whey+isolate&tag=beardednotary-20" target="_blank" rel="sponsored noopener noreferrer">Check price on Amazon</a></p>

