                    <h3>Sources:</h3>
                    <ul>
                        <li><strong>Labdoor</strong> — Certificate of Analysis, MyProtein Impact Whey Isolate, lot U41582255, sampled November–December 2024, 1 scoop (31.5g). Heavy metals: arsenic, cadmium, mercury undetected; lead below LOQ. Purity: PASS. Accuracy: PASS (25g claimed, 25.3g found).</li>
                        <li><strong>Environmental Research Center</strong> — California Proposition 65 Notices of Violation against Cend International dba MyProtein (May 13 and June 11, 2019) alleging lead and/or cadmium; civil complaint against The Hut Group Limited dba MyProtein (September 3, 2019); settlement June 9, 2020; judgment September 8, 2020; $198,000 total paid.</li>
