                        <li><strong>Consumer Reports</strong>, October 2025 and January 2026 protein testing rounds — MyProtein not included. Whey averaged ~9× less lead than plant proteins.</li>
                        <li><strong>USP</strong> daily limits used in the Labdoor panel: lead 5 µg, arsenic 15 µg, cadmium 5 µg, mercury 15 µg. <strong>California OEHHA</strong>, Prop 65 safe harbor for lead: 0.5 µg/day.</li>
